<title>JAPAN: Russia official &quot;no comment&quot; on palladium report.</title>
<headline>Russia official &quot;no comment&quot; on palladium report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Russian trade official in Tokyo declined to comment on Thursday about an unidentified report circulating in the market that Russian palladium supplies to Japan may resume before the end of March.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't want to make any comment,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Palladium futures fell sharply in New York overnight on the unidentified report that Russian palladium supplies to Japan may resume before the end of March.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
